<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>SQL Injection Labs - EliteHackLab</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="matrix-bg"></div>
  <nav class="main-nav">
    <div class="nav-brand"><span class="brand-icon">💀</span><span class="brand-text">Elite<span class="highlight">Hack</span>Lab</span></div>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="/"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Dashboard</a>
      <a href="/scoreboard"><i class="fas fa-trophy"></i> Scoreboard</a>
    </div>
  </nav>
  <div class="lab-container">
    <div class="lab-header">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / SQL Injection</div>
      <h1>💉 SQL Injection Labs</h1>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin-top: 0.5rem;">Master SQL Injection from basic to advanced techniques</p>
    </div>

    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-book"></i> Theory</h2>
      <p>SQL Injection occurs when user input is directly concatenated into SQL queries without proper sanitization or parameterization. This allows attackers to manipulate the query logic to extract data, bypass authentication, or even execute commands on the database server.</p>
      <div class="code-block">
-- Vulnerable Query:
SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = '$input' AND password = '$password'

-- Attack Payload:
username: admin' OR '1'='1' --
password: anything

-- Resulting Query:
SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = 'admin' OR '1'='1' --' AND password = 'anything'
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-flask"></i> Available Labs</h2>
      <div class="lab-list">
        <% labs.forEach(function(lab) { %>
          <a href="<%= lab.path %>" class="lab-link">
            <span class="lab-name"><i class="fas fa-terminal"></i> <%= lab.name %></span>
            <span class="lab-difficulty <%= lab.difficulty.toLowerCase() %>"><%= lab.difficulty %></span>
          </a>
        <% }); %>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-lightbulb"></i> Techniques Covered</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Basic string-based injection</li>
        <li>UNION SELECT to extract data from other tables</li>
        <li>Boolean-based blind injection</li>
        <li>Time-based blind injection</li>
        <li>Authentication bypass</li>
        <li>Second-order injection (stored payload)</li>
        <li>Error-based extraction</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
